Spec: Admin authentication

Purpose:
  Session-based login for a single admin. Everyone else is a read-only viewer.

Owns:
  ./auth.py

Must:
  A login form checks the submitted password against `ADMIN_PASSWORD` and on success stores admin status in the signed
  session.
  A logout action clears the admin session.
  Write routes reject requests without an admin session.
  Login is impossible when `ADMIN_PASSWORD` is unset or empty.
  The password comparison is constant-time.

Must not:
  The password must not be logged, rendered or stored in the database.

Tasks:
  [ ] Implement login, logout and the admin guard
  [ ] Show a login link to visitors and a logout link to the admin in the header
